  "inkContent": {
    "en": {
      "inkVersion": 21,
      "root": [
        [
          "\n",
          "^We finally meet! How was my day-quest? ",
          "#",
          "^speaker:npc_solomiia",
          "/#",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          {
            "VAR?": "task_flowers"
          },
          "/ev",
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b",
              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^Flowers for Grandma! She'll be so happy. ",
                "#",
                "^take:flowers",
                "/#",
                "\n",
                {
                  "->": "0.11"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b"
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^No flowers? Never mind, we'll buy some tomorrow together.",
                "\n",
                {
                  "->": "0.11"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          {
            "VAR?": "task_dessert"
          },
          "/ev",
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b",
              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^And cherry strudel! How did you know I love it? ",
                "#",
                "^take:dessert",
                "/#",
                "\n",
                {
                  "->": "0.18"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b"
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^No dessert? No problem, I know a great café.",
                "\n",
                {
                  "->": "0.18"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          {
            "VAR?": "task_show_time"
          },
          "/ev",
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b",
              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^And you know when the show starts! «О восьмій», at eight. Any minute now.",
                "\n",
                {
                  "->": "0.25"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b"
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^The show is at eight, «о восьмій». We made it just in time.",
                "\n",
                {
                  "->": "0.25"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          {
            "VAR?": "has_drawing"
          },
          "/ev",
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b",
              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^Wait, is this drawing by the artist from Mury? My grandma knows him!",
                "\n",
                {
                  "->": "0.31"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "^By the way, tomorrow we could visit the Pirogov estate.",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^Пирогов був хірургом! (Pirogov was a surgeon!)",
          "/str",
          {
            "VAR?": "knows_pirogov"
          },
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-0",
            "flg": 21
          },
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^А хто такий Пирогов? (Who is Pirogov?)",
          "/str",
          {
            "VAR?": "knows_pirogov"
          },
          "!",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-1",
            "flg": 21
          },
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^Із задоволенням! (With pleasure!)",
          "/str",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-2",
            "flg": 20
          },
          {
            "c-0": [
              "\n",
              "^Wow, you already know! Then you'll be my tour assistant.",
              "\n",
              "ev",
              {
                "VAR?": "trust"
              },
              1,
              "+",
              {
                "VAR=": "trust",
                "re": true
              },
              "/ev",
              {
                "->": "0.g-0"
              },
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ],
            "c-1": [
              "\n",
              "^A famous surgeon, «хірург». I'll tell you on the way.",
              "\n",
              {
                "->": "0.g-0"
              },
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ],
            "c-2": [
              "\n",
              "ev",
              true,
              "/ev",
              {
                "VAR=": "polite",
                "re": true
              },
              "^«Домовились!» Deal!",
              "\n",
              {
                "->": "0.g-0"
              },
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ],
            "g-0": [
              "^Look! The sun is setting... The fountain! ",
              "#",
              "^clock:20:00 ",
              "/#",
              "#",
              "^cutscene:fountain",
              "/#",
              "\n",
